regenerated `src/agent/masterPromptText.ts` had local CRLF differences in the working
tree. The tree was returned to the index state (`git checkout --` on that one file,
which is generated from `prompts/loam-master.md`), after which the merge applied cleanly
with the `ort` strategy and **no conflict at all**. Committed as `02df9b8`.

