   conflicted `.jdone` again with the same shape. Resolved the same way: O1 + D15 + V11 +
   the rollup. Committed as `c60a574`.
3. manus-parity advanced once more (H1, `learning/harness/types.ts`). That merge applied
   cleanly with no conflicts. Committed as `579ff21`.

Verified mechanically that the resolved `.jdone` is a **superset of both conflict sides**:
`git diff --no-index` between each stage-2/stage-3 blob and the working file produced zero
`<` lines (nothing dropped from either side). No test was weakened, deleted or skipped and
no source file was changed.

